%N A401875 Number of dissections of a rhombus with side length n in a triangular lattice into two identical parts, counting dissections equal under rotation or reflection only once.
%C A401875 The dissections are along grid lines.
%C A401875 In other words, the number of distinct ways to dissect a polyiamond with 2*n^2 cells and rhombus shape into two identical polyiamonds with n^2 cells each.
%e A401875 The rhombus of side length 2 and its a(2) = 2 distinct dissections are:
